# MQ10 "Bruma Gate". Martin's "What else can I do to help?" set MQ10 10. Jauffre: an Oblivion Gate has opened
# outside Bruma (20); Captain Burd waits there with his guardsmen (30), speaks to them (31 .. 33) and follows the
# player into the Gate (35). With Burd in the Sigil Stone chamber (40) the player takes the Stone (50). Burd thanks
# the player (55), Jauffre is pleased (60 -> 100), and MQ11 starts at 10.
# DRAFT from tools/live/quest_brief.py (2026-11-13): not run yet.

# Jauffre's greeting at 10 ("I've just received word from the Countess of Bruma ...", INFO 00026EA7) offers "Where
# is this Gate?" (INFO 00026EFB), which sets 20: the Gate, the guardsmen and Burd at MQ10BurdWaitMarker.
case mq10_jauffre
until 300 GetStage MQ10 >= 10
run
player.moveto JauffreRef
wait 120
approach JauffreRef
talk JauffreRef
ask "Where is this Gate?"
until 300 GetStage MQ10 >= 20
bye if open
end

# Burd outside Bruma: his greeting at 20 ("Thanks for coming ...", INFO 00026EE9) sets 30 and offers "Let's go."
# (INFO 0003A853, 31). He then speaks to his men (BurdSCRIPT OnPackageDone MQ10BurdGiveSpeech: 32) and the fight
# at the Gate starts (33). The walk to Bruma is the player's travel: moveto stands in.
case mq10_burd
defend BurdRef
run
player.moveto MQ10BurdWaitMarker
wait 120
approach BurdRef
talk BurdRef
until 300 GetStage MQ10 >= 30
ask "Let's go."
until 300 GetStage MQ10 >= 31
bye if open
until 3600 GetStage MQ10 >= 33
end

# The player enters the Gate (MQ10OblivionGateScript OnActivate: MQ10.playerInOblivion 1); MQ10Script sets 35 once
# the player and Burd are both within 5000 of MQ10BurdWaitInsideGateMarker, so Burd must follow through the Gate.
case mq10_enter_gate
defend BurdRef
run
player.moveto MQ10OblivionGate
wait 120
activate MQ10OblivionGate
until 600 MQ10.playerInOblivion == 1
until 600 player.GetDistance MQ10BurdWaitInsideGateMarker < 5000
until 3600 GetStage MQ10 >= 35
end

# The climb to the Sigil Stone is the player's fight with Burd at their side: moveto stands in for it and Burd, who
# follows the player, is brought along. With both in the chamber the Stone's activator sets 40
# (MQ10SigilStoneActivatorScript); activating it then takes the Stone, which closes the Gate and sets 50.
case mq10_sigil_stone
defend BurdRef
run
player.moveto MQ10Sigil
wait 120
run
BurdRef.moveto player
until 600 GetStage MQ10 >= 40
activate MQ10Sigil
until 1800 GetStage MQ10 >= 50
until 600 MQ10.playerInOblivion == 0
end

# Back outside Bruma, Burd's greeting at 50 ("It was an honor to serve with you ...", INFO 00026EEB / 00026EEC)
# sets 55. Jauffre's greeting at 55 ("Good work. ...", INFO 00026EA8) sets 60, whose result sets 100; that sets
# MQ11 10.
case mq10_report
run
player.moveto BurdRef
wait 120
approach BurdRef
talk BurdRef
until 600 GetStage MQ10 >= 55
bye if open
run
player.moveto JauffreRef
wait 120
approach JauffreRef
talk JauffreRef
until 600 GetStage MQ10 >= 60
until 300 GetStageDone MQ10 100
until 300 GetStage MQ11 >= 10
bye if open
end
